{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54651","headline":"兵要望江南 占雷第九（京本列第二十五○三十一首） 三十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雷第九（京本列第二十五○三十一首） 三十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"商音姓，鸣忌在离方。\n角姓兑乾宫震巽，羽防坤艮及中央，徴姓坎方殃。\n（天子出取天子姓，不出只以主将姓幷日干爲主，以八方生尅断。\n诀云：甲乙兑乾方，丙丁坎上当。\n戊己防震巽，庚辛离有殃。\n壬癸艮坤位，中央总不祥。\n我尅他军败，他尅我军伤。\n生他虽用计，生我自投降。\n上天昭应验，良将细推详。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54651.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54651","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}